    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lisiku line Yelobowamu ŵajimi pambali pa malo gakupelecela mbopesi ku Beteli, ŵaliji mkuliŵicila cile kutaga mbopesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwacisisimucisya mundu jwakulocesya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jwa Mlungu ŵayice ku Beteliko, kutyocela ku Yuda mpela muŵandamulile AMBUJE.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Nipo ŵagalwesile malo gakupelecela mbopesigo, pakusala maloŵe ga ŵamlamwile AMBUJE, ŵatite, “Malo gakupelecela mbopesi agano, malo gakupelecela mbopesi agano, mpikane maloŵe ga AMBUJE, akusala kuti, ‘Mwanace jwamlume tacipagwa mwiŵasa lya Daudi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " lina lyakwe tiliciŵa Yosiya. Jwalakwejo, tacimwulajila jemanja ŵakutaga mbopesi, ŵele ŵakutumicila ni kupeleka mbopesi pa malo agano, nipo mawupa ga ŵandu tacigajoca pa malo gakupelecela mbopesi gelega.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.23.15+2KI.23.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ayi 23:15-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo mundu jwakulocesya jwa Mlungu jula ŵaŵecete soni maloŵe gakuti, “Malo gakupelecela mbopesi gelega tigacigumuka nipo liwu liticiŵa pelepo tilicimwalamwasika. Nipo timcimanyilila kuti AMBUJE aŵecete kupitila mwa une.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Yelobowamu piŵapikene yakuŵeceta ya mundu jwakulocesya jwa Mlungu jula, ya kusala ya malo gakupelecela mbopesi ga ku Beteli gala, jwalakwe ŵamlosisye cala ali kumalo gakupelecela mbopesi gala, mundu jwakulocesya jwa Mlungu jula, ni ŵatite, “Mumkamule!” Ndaŵi jijojo mkono uŵalocesyaga cala mundu jwakutaga mbopesi jwa Mlungu jula, wajumwile kuti gwaa, ni nganapakombola kuwuwucisya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndaŵi jijojo malo gakupelecela mbopesi gala gaŵalwice cilikati, nipo liwu lilyaliji pacanya pakwe lyakusucile pasi, mpela mwele muŵaŵecetele mundu jwakulocesya jwa Mlungu jula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo Mwenye Yelobowamu ŵaŵecete ni mundu jwakulocesya jwa Mlungu jula kuti, “Conde mumbopelele kwa AMBUJE Mlungu jwenu kuti andendele canasa, kuti mkono wanguwu upole.” Mundu jwakulocesya jwa Mlungu jula ŵapopesile kwa AMBUJE, nipo mkono wa mwenye ula ŵaposile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Papopo mwenye ŵala ŵatite kwa mundu jwakulocesya jwa Mlungu jula, “Kwende tujawule ku nyumba jangu, kuti mkalye yakulya, nipo tingampe mtuka pa yindu yimundendeleyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo mundu jwakulocesya jwa Mlungu jula, ŵajanjile kuti, “Atamose ali ambele hafu ja cipanje cawo cosope, une ngajenda ni ŵalakwe, kapena kulya ni kumwa ni ŵalakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pakuŵa AMBUJE andamwile kuti ngalya kapena kumwa kandu akuno, kapena kupitila soni litala lilyolyo limbitile pakwisa akuno.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo mundu jwakulocesya jwa Mlungu jula, ŵapitile litala line, nganapitila soni litala liŵapitile pakwawula ku Beteli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mundu jwakulocesya jwamcekulupe jwa ku Beteli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndaŵi jelejo ku Beteli kwaliji mkutama mundu jwakulocesya jwa Mlungu jwamcekulupe. Ŵanace ŵakwe ŵayice kukumsalila yosope yiŵayitesile mundu jwakulocesya jwa Mlungu ku Beteli lyele lisikulyo, ni yosope yiŵaŵecete kwa Mwenye Yelobowamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo mundu jwakulocesya jwa Mlungu jwa mcekulupe jula, ŵawusisye ŵanace ŵakwe ŵala kuti, “Ana apitile litala lyakwe lyapi?” Ŵanace ŵakwe ŵala ŵamlosisye litala liŵapitile mundu jwakulocesya jwa Mlungu jwakutyocela ku Yuda jula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndaŵi jijojo mdala jula ŵasalile ŵanace ŵakwe ŵala kuti ataŵilile sadulo pa bulu. Ŵanace ŵala ŵataŵilile sadulojo, nipo ngalamba jila jakwesile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalambajo, jamkuyisye mundu jwakulocesya jwa Mlungu jwakutyocela ku Yuda jula, ni ŵajile kumsimana ali atemi pa m'bwilili, kusi kwa citela ca mtundu. Mdala jula ŵawusisye kuti, “Ana ŵalakwe ni mundu jwakulocesya jwa Mlungu jwatyocele ku Yuda?” Mundu jula ŵajanjile kuti, “Elo, ni uneji.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalamba jila jatite, “Kwende kumangwetu tukalye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo mundu jwakulocesya jwa kutyocela ku Yuda jula ŵajanjile kuti, “Une ngakomboleka kuwujilila ni ŵalakwe, soni une ngaŵa mkulya kapena kumwa cindu cilicose ni ŵalakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ligongo AMBUJE andamwile une kuti ngalya kapena kumwa cindu cilicose, kapena kuwujila kumangwetu pakupitila litala linapitile pakwawula.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo ngalamba ja ku Beteli jila jamsalile kuti, “Une soni ndili mundu jwakulocesya mpela m'mwejo, nipo lilayika lya AMBUJE lyayice kukusalila une, kuti namjigale m'mwejo tujawule ku nyumba jangu kuti mkalye yakulya ni kumwa mesi.” Nambo ngalambaji jaliji mkuŵeceta ya unami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo mundu jwakulocesya jwa Mlungu jwakutyocela ku Yuda jula, jwawujilile najo mdala jula mpaka ku nyumba jakwe, nipo ŵalile yakulya ni kumwa mesi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndaŵi jiŵaliji mkulya, AMBUJE ŵaŵecete ni jwakulocesya jwa mcekulupe juŵamwusisye mjakwe petala jula, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nipo ŵagumisile kwa mundu jwakulocesya jwakutyocela ku Yuda jula kuti, “Mpikane maloŵe ga AMBUJE, akuti nganimwapikanila AMBUJE Mlungu jwenu, ni nginimkuya lilamusi lyawo liŵalamwile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "M'malo mwakwe mwujilile, mlile yakulya ni kumwa mwesi pa malo gele AMBUJE giŵamsalile kuti mkaja kulya yakulya, kapena kuja kumwa mesi. Ligongo lya yindu yimtesileyi timwulajidwe, nambo mtembo wenu ngasawusika ku malembe ga acinangolo ŵenu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
