          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵawusicile mtembowo ku malembe ga acinangolo ŵakwe. Jwalakwe ni ŵanace ŵakwe pakulila ŵatiji kuti, “Ngondone mlongo mjangu! Ngondone mlongo mjangu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo ali amsicile m'malembe, jwakulocesya jwamcekulupe jula ŵasalile ŵanace ŵakwe kuti, “Patinjiwa une, timusice mwilembe lyagonile jwakulocesya jwa Mlunguju. Timwugonece mtembo wangu pa mbali pa mtembo wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Une ngukulupilila kuti yosope yiŵaŵecete jwakulocesya jwa Mlungu jwa kutyocela ku Yuda, yakwamba malo gakupelecela mbopesi ga ku Beteli ni malo gosope gakulambila ga ku Samaliya, nditu tiyicitendekwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
