          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo atamose kuti yindu yaliji myoyo, Mwenye Yelobowamu jwa cilambo ca Isalaeli, nganaleka matala gakwe gakusakala. Ŵasagwile ŵandu wamba, ŵimkanaŵa Alefi, kuŵa ŵakutaga mbopesi, ŵiŵatumicilaga m'malo gakupelecela mbopesi giŵataŵile jwalakwe. Mundu jwalijose juŵasakaga kuŵa jwakutaga mbopesi, ŵamkundile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ligongo lya ulemwa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " waukulungwa welewu, liŵasa lya Yelobowamu lyajonasice lyosope, ni mtundu wakwe wosope wasimasice pa cilambo cosope capasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.34"
            ]
          }
